+
+Repeat native commands with `gl_compatibility`. Original complete `.ctex` mip chains and frozen rewind/fire source fixtures are retained for A/B tests; derived decoded ETC2 Images are regenerated under `build/`, outside shipping resources. The evidence report identifies the actual commands and source fingerprints because concurrent unrelated work changed the overall client build identity during this task.
+
+A full client restart/reimport is required to inspect the final resources. Owner visual acceptance should cover crowded Night light transitions and compressed artwork at ordinary and close camera distances. The next device gate remains a release Android build on the Nord 2 and weaker hardware: all biomes, dense props/tyres, maximum fire, cold and cached starts, repeated restarts/rewinds, background/resume and a 20-minute thermal soak. Record CPU/physics/GPU P50/P95/P99, draw calls/triangles, memory/PSS and thermal state. Existing unrelated F11+ audit risks and pathological overlapping tyre loads remain outside this slice.
+
+No phone attachment check, physical-device test, APK/export/install, live backend/account mutation or deployment was performed. Concurrent editor, challenge, Desert, audio and backend changes are preserved. No native source or binary was changed by this task.
